<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3DO cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3DO cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its recommendation on 3DO Co to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade, the shares fell one to 5-3/4.</p>
